  "idea": "Automated employee equipment ordering and home office stipend flow",
  "text": "Here is the modern IT equipment management solution built for fast-scaling remote companies. Tracking serial numbers, warranty repairs, and operating system updates across dozens of countries creates security vulnerabilities. When offboarding occurs, unrecovered company hardware exposes proprietary codebase repositories and customer databases to breaches. Platforms like GroWrk or Firstbase link Kandji MDM with automated global retrieval boxes and certified data wipes. This secures your distributed fleet effortlessly.",
